    "description": "Chronicles the misadventures of an inept Beverly Hills producer who believes she can ride the coattails of the original movie's success by filming a follow-up. Bankrolled by her father, she hires a documentary director, his production crew and four actors in an attempt to track down evidence related to the \"West Woods Witch.\" Events start to unravel as the motley group encounters other film crews in the woods and end up getting lost themselves. Is the curse of the \"West Woods Witch\" for real... or something else entirely?",
